<script lang="ts">
  import { actions,app } from '#lib/state/app';
  let fullName='',phone='',outletName='',secret='',password='',confirm='',busy=false,error='',number='';
  async function setup(){busy=true;error='';try{if(password!==confirm)throw new Error('Konfirmasi kata sandi belum sama.');const result=await actions.bootstrap({fullName,phone,outletName,secret,password});number=result.employee_number;secret='';password='';confirm='';}catch(e){error=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Admin awal belum dapat dibuat.';}finally{busy=false;}}
</script>
<svelte:head><title>Pengaturan awal · Rajaklana HR</title><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/></svelte:head>
<main><a href="/login" class="brand"><img src="/icon.svg" alt=""/>rajaklana HR</a><section class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">PENGATURAN PERTAMA</span><h1>Siapkan Admin HR</h1>{#if number}<div class="success">Admin pertama berhasil dibuat. Nomor karyawan Anda: <strong>{number}</strong>.</div><p>Masuk, lengkapi lokasi outlet, lalu daftarkan anggota tim. Kode pengaturan awal perlu dihapus dari konfigurasi server setelah selesai.</p><a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Masuk ke aplikasi</a>{:else if $app.mode==='demo'}<p>Supabase belum dikonfigurasi. Anda dapat mencoba aplikasi menggunakan akun contoh terlebih dahulu.</p><a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Coba aplikasi</a>{:else}<p>Halaman ini hanya dapat membuat satu admin pertama dengan kode pengaturan yang dikonfigurasi pada server.</p><form on:submit|preventDefault={setup}><label class="field">Nama lengkap<input class="input" required bind:value={fullName} autocomplete="name"/></label><label class="field">Nomor WhatsApp<input class="input" required type="tel" bind:value={phone} autocomplete="tel"/></label><label class="field">Nama outlet pertama<input class="input" required bind:value={outletName}/></label><label class="field">Kode pengaturan awal<input class="input" type="password" required minlength="32" bind:value={secret} autocomplete="off"/></label><label class="field">Kata sandi akun<input class="input" type="password" required minlength="10" maxlength="128" bind:value={password} autocomplete="new-password"/></label><label class="field">Konfirmasi kata sandi<input class="input" type="password" required minlength="10" bind:value={confirm} autocomplete="new-password"/></label>{#if error}<div class="error" role="alert">{error}</div>{/if}<button class="btn btn-primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Menyiapkan…':'Buat Admin HR pertama'}</button></form>{/if}</section></main>
<style>main{min-height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 20px;gap:28px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-family:Manrope;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px}.brand img{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px}.panel{width:min(460px,100%);padding:28px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1.6px}h1{font-size:24px;margin:17px 0}p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}</style>
